        <type>QStringList</type>
        <definition>BERNESE_EXPORT QStringList bernese::platform_utils::PlatformPluginKeys</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>PlatformPluginKeys</name>
        <qualifiedname>bernese::platform_utils::PlatformPluginKeys</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>List the keys of all installed Qt platform plugins. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads the plugin metadata without loading the plugins. Searches the folder in QT_QPA_PLATFORM_PLUGIN_PATH and the &quot;platforms&quot; folder of every Qt library path, like Qt does. It replaces QPlatformIntegrationFactory::keys().</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>It also works before the application object exists, so it can be used to choose QT_QPA_PLATFORM. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Plugin keys such as &quot;xcb&quot; or &quot;wayland&quot;, without duplicates. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
